# REELYOU Splash — Locked Beta Baseline

The splash screen is **approved production artwork**. Treat it as locked.

## Do NOT change (unless the user explicitly requests it)

- Artwork (`assets/images/splash-approved.png`)
- Composition, layout, framing, spacing
- Logo position or size
- Background, clouds, sunrise, mountains, stars
- Colors, lighting, typography

## Allowed without prior approval

- Bug fixes
- Performance improvements
- Responsiveness
- Animation optimization (must not alter the approved look)

## Required before any visual change

If a request would visually alter the splash screen, **ask for approval first** and explain the exact delta.

## Baseline asset

- Master artwork: `assets/images/splash-approved.png`
- Entry screen: `src/screens/SplashScreen.tsx`
